docs {
  # Delete project

  Authentication: authenticated session cookie; requires `owner` or `admin` membership.
  Expected response: `200` with `{ "deleted": true }`.
  Error cases: `401` `UNAUTHENTICATED`; `403` `FORBIDDEN`; `404` `PROJECT_NOT_FOUND`.
}
